[en-us]
name         = "SFTPGo File Server"
auth         = "Moechz"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript         = "SFTPGo is a full-featured file transfer server supporting SFTP, WebDAV, FTP/S and HTTP/S, with local and cloud storage backends (S3-compatible, GCS, Azure). It bundles a complete WebAdmin for managing virtual users, folders, groups, event rules and file shares, plus a WebClient so users can browse, upload and share files from the browser with optional two-factor authentication. On TOS it opens in a new browser tab; all web traffic (including WebDAV and the REST API) goes through the TOS web server route /sftpgo/ with the backend listening on loopback only. SFTP is served on port 2022. There is NO default account: the first time you open the app you are guided to create your own administrator (choose your own username and password). Accounts and data live in /var/lib/sftpgo; the server runs as a dedicated unprivileged user in a hardened systemd sandbox."
release_note         = "Bundles the official SFTPGo 2.7.5 static binary (Go, zero runtime dependencies) with the SQLite data provider. Web UIs at /sftpgo/web/admin and /sftpgo/web/client, WebDAV mount point /sftpgo/webdav/, REST API /sftpgo/api/v2/, SFTP on port 2022. FIRST LOGIN: no default username/password is preset - opening the app for the first time automatically shows a setup wizard where you create the administrator account yourself. Privacy policy: /sftpgo/privacy/."
important         = "First-time setup: there is no default account. Open http://<NAS-IP>:8181/sftpgo/ and the setup wizard will guide you through creating the administrator (your own username and password - keep them safe; two-factor authentication can be enabled afterwards in the admin profile). SFTP listens on port 2022 (open it in your firewall/router as needed); FTP is disabled by default. Privacy policy: https://<NAS-IP>:8181/sftpgo/privacy/ - the app makes no outbound connections unless you configure integrations."

[zh-cn]
name         = "SFTPGo 文件服务器"
auth         = "Moechz"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript         = "SFTPGo 是功能完备的文件传输服务器，支持 SFTP、WebDAV、FTP/S 与 HTTP/S，后端存储可用本地目录或云存储（S3 兼容、GCS、Azure）。内置完整 WebAdmin 管理端（虚拟用户、目录、组、事件规则、文件分享）与 WebClient 用户端（浏览器内浏览/上传/分享文件，支持两步验证）。在 TOS 上以新标签页方式打开，全部 Web 流量（含 WebDAV 与 REST API）经 TOS 网页服务的 /sftpgo/ 路由转发，后端仅监听回环、不额外暴露端口；SFTP 服务监听 2022 端口。本应用没有默认账号：首次打开会自动引导你创建管理员（用户名、密码均由你自己设定）。账号与数据保存在 /var/lib/sftpgo；服务以专用非特权用户运行并施加 systemd 沙箱加固。"
release_note         = "内置 SFTPGo 2.7.5 官方静态二进制（Go 编译，零运行时依赖），默认 SQLite 存储。Web 管理端 /sftpgo/web/admin、用户端 /sftpgo/web/client、WebDAV 挂载点 /sftpgo/webdav/、REST API /sftpgo/api/v2/、SFTP 端口 2022。首次使用：本应用不预置任何默认账号密码——首次打开应用会自动弹出初始化向导，由你自己创建管理员账户。隐私政策：/sftpgo/privacy/。"
important         = "首次使用：本应用没有默认账号密码。打开 http://<NAS的IP>:8181/sftpgo/，初始化向导会引导你创建管理员（用户名与密码均由你自定，请妥善保管；创建后可在个人资料中开启两步验证）。SFTP 监听 2022 端口（按需在防火墙/路由器放行）；FTP 默认关闭。隐私政策：https://<NAS的IP>:8181/sftpgo/privacy/ ——除您自行配置的集成外，应用自身不对外发起任何连接。"

[zh-hk]
name         = "SFTPGo 檔案伺服器"
auth         = "Moechz"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript         = "SFTPGo 是功能完備的檔案傳輸伺服器，支援 SFTP、WebDAV、FTP/S 與 HTTP/S，後端儲存可用本機目錄或雲端儲存（S3 相容、GCS、Azure）。內建完整 WebAdmin 管理端（虛擬使用者、目錄、群組、事件規則、檔案分享）與 WebClient 使用者端（瀏覽器內瀏覽/上傳/分享檔案，支援兩步驟驗證）。在 TOS 上以新分頁方式開啟，全部 Web 流量（含 WebDAV 與 REST API）經 TOS 網頁服務的 /sftpgo/ 路由轉發，後端僅監聽回環、不額外暴露連接埠；SFTP 服務監聽 2022 連接埠。本應用沒有預設帳號：首次開啟會自動引導你建立管理員（使用者名稱、密碼均由你自己設定）。帳號與資料儲存在 /var/lib/sftpgo；服務以專用非特權使用者執行並施加 systemd 沙箱強化。"
release_note         = "內建 SFTPGo 2.7.5 官方靜態二進位（Go 編譯，零執行相依），預設 SQLite 儲存。Web 管理端 /sftpgo/web/admin、使用者端 /sftpgo/web/client、WebDAV 掛載點 /sftpgo/webdav/、REST API /sftpgo/api/v2/、SFTP 連接埠 2022。首次使用：本應用不預置任何預設帳號密碼——首次開啟應用會自動彈出初始化精靈，由你自己建立管理員帳戶。隱私政策：/sftpgo/privacy/。"
important         = "首次使用：本應用沒有預設帳號密碼。開啟 http://<NAS的IP>:8181/sftpgo/，初始化精靈會引導你建立管理員（使用者名稱與密碼均由你自訂，請妥善保管；建立後可在個人資料中開啟兩步驟驗證）。SFTP 監聽 2022 連接埠（按需在防火牆/路由器放行）；FTP 預設關閉。隱私政策：https://<NAS的IP>:8181/sftpgo/privacy/ ——除您自行設定的整合外，應用自身不對外發起任何連線。"

[fr-fr]
name         = "SFTPGo File Server"
auth         = "Moechz"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript         = "SFTPGo is a full-featured file transfer server supporting SFTP, WebDAV, FTP/S and HTTP/S, with local and cloud storage backends (S3-compatible, GCS, Azure). It bundles a complete WebAdmin for managing virtual users, folders, groups, event rules and file shares, plus a WebClient so users can browse, upload and share files from the browser with optional two-factor authentication. On TOS it opens in a new browser tab; all web traffic (including WebDAV and the REST API) goes through the TOS web server route /sftpgo/ with the backend listening on loopback only. SFTP is served on port 2022. There is NO default account: the first time you open the app you are guided to create your own administrator (choose your own username and password). Accounts and data live in /var/lib/sftpgo; the server runs as a dedicated unprivileged user in a hardened systemd sandbox."
release_note         = "Bundles the official SFTPGo 2.7.5 static binary (Go, zero runtime dependencies) with the SQLite data provider. Web UIs at /sftpgo/web/admin and /sftpgo/web/client, WebDAV mount point /sftpgo/webdav/, REST API /sftpgo/api/v2/, SFTP on port 2022. FIRST LOGIN: no default username/password is preset - opening the app for the first time automatically shows a setup wizard where you create the administrator account yourself. Privacy policy: /sftpgo/privacy/."
important         = "First-time setup: there is no default account. Open http://<NAS-IP>:8181/sftpgo/ and the setup wizard will guide you through creating the administrator (your own username and password - keep them safe; two-factor authentication can be enabled afterwards in the admin profile). SFTP listens on port 2022 (open it in your firewall/router as needed); FTP is disabled by default. Privacy policy: https://<NAS-IP>:8181/sftpgo/privacy/ - the app makes no outbound connections unless you configure integrations."

